  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往法兰城剧院（185.151）1层与疯草帽（13.53）对话，获取【莫吉托配方】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.清晨，前往亚留特村北门外的亚留特西方洞窟（549.43），通过（11.7）处楼梯进入海盗的祠堂。",
      "type": "time-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆清晨：现实时间的单数小时47分~双数小时02分（略有浮动，建议早去）",
      "type": "time-definition",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.与捣蛋鬼（25.6）对话，传送至海贼洞窟。（无需海贼三件套）",
      "type": "teleport-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆洞内魔物：Lv.12~15，盗贼、海盗、海蝙蝠，数量1~5",
      "type": "maze-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆海贼洞窟行走路线：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "4.通过海贼的洞窟抵达野狼船长的灵堂，与海盗的传送门（16.25附近，红色传送石）对话，传送至德拉盖的结界。",
      "type": "teleport-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "5.与海贼王德拉盖（22.17）对话，二连战。",
      "type": "consecutive-battle",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◆第一战",
      "type": "round-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "LV.70 海贼王德拉盖，2动，抗咒，HP≈12000；技能：攻击、中毒攻击、混乱攻击、攻击吸收、魔法吸收、魔法反弹",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "LV.60 骷髅海盗*4，1动，HP≈1100；技能：攻击、诸刃、战栗袭心",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "LV.60 亡灵*5，2动：HP≈1000，技能：攻击、风刃魔法，强力风刃魔法",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "◆第二战",
      "type": "round-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "LV.70 野狼船长（极），2动，抗咒：HP≈16000，技能：攻击、圣盾、明镜止水、即死魔法、阳炎、乾坤一掷、吸血攻击（500）",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "LV.60 骷髅海盗*4，1动：HP≈1100，技能：攻击、诸刃、乾坤一掷、战栗袭心",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "LV.60 亡灵*5，2动：HP≈1000，技能：攻击、风刃魔法、强力风刃魔法",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◇野狼船长（极）魔法被抽干后依然可以使用明镜止水、圣盾、吸血攻击",
      "type": "battle-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "※战斗完有一定几率掉落奖品",
      "type": "chance-drop-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "奖品属性",
      "type": "reward-table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "海贼王的福袋双击后提示开启打卡时间，选“是”获取随机奖励（不会打卡）不可交易",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "野狼船长的帽子等级3，帽子，耐久200，",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "属性：生命+100~160，魔力+100~160；装备后得称号“野狼的恰恰舞”可丢地",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
