        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "野狼斗篷等级6，衣服，耐久260~299，",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "属性：防御+80~100，必杀+5，命中+2，闪避+5，生命+50~100；明镜止水耗魔减少10%可交易",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "恶魔之果等级8，护身符，耐久200，",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "属性：攻击+20，敏捷+10，精神+6，抗毒+8，抗混乱+6，必杀+11，命中+11，魔攻+20，数值浮动；装备后得称号“追光的恶魔”可交易",
